      "id": "q1",
      "type": "compare",
      "q": "What separates thought leadership from ordinary content?",
      "a": "It adds new insight with evidence and a point of view, instead of summarizing others.",
      "anchor": "#what-makes-content-thought-leadership",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "recall",
      "q": "Name four sources of original insight.",
      "a": "First-hand experience, original data, synthesis, frameworks and evidence-based contrarian views.",
      "anchor": "#sources-of-original-insight",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
